# A field is set at creation when the constructor stores it on every path before it returns
# RUN(TIGHT): flow-construction
# RUN(ARM): flow-construction
# RUN(TIGHTFIELDS): flow-solve nodes
# RUN(ARMFIELDS): flow-solve nodes

module m0 path="main.js" displayPath="main.js" body=f0
entry module=m0
layout L0 kind=Instance name="Tight" constructor=f1 fields=[{key="x" declared={type=number} flags=[IsRequired]}, {key="y" declared={type=number} flags=[IsRequired]}]
layout L1 kind=Instance name="OneArm" constructor=f2 fields=[{key="x" declared={type=number} flags=[IsRequired]}, {key="y" declared={type=number} flags=[IsRequired]}]
function f0 name="main" kind=Module results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0():
    v0 = NewClosure function=f1
    v1 = NewClass v0 layout=L0
    v2 = FinishClass v1 layout=L0
    v3 = Construct v2
    v4 = NewClosure function=f2
    v5 = NewClass v4 layout=L1
    v6 = FinishClass v5 layout=L1
    v7 = Builtin builtin=MathRandom
    v8 = Call v7
    v9 = Construct v6, -, v8
    Return
}
function f1 name="Tight" kind=BaseConstructor flags=[HasNewTarget] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: anything):
    v1 = GetConstructPrototype v0 layout=L0
    v2 = NewObject v1 layout=L0
    v3 = Integer integer=1
    PropSet v2, v3 key="x"
    v5 = Integer integer=2
    PropSet v2, v5 key="y"
    Return v2
}
# TIGHT: construction f1@i{{*}} root v2: DoesNotLeak before-leak "x" "y" at-exit "x" "y" read-early initial-order "x" "y" stores OnlyInitialOrder
# TIGHT-NOT: construction f1@i{{*}}: Unknown
# TIGHT: layout L0: DoesNotLeak OnlyAtConstruction set [0, 1] orders [0, 1]
# TIGHTFIELDS: DeclaredPart(L0#{{*}}, 0) = {1}
# TIGHTFIELDS: DeclaredPart(L0#{{*}}, 1) = {2}
function f2 name="OneArm" kind=BaseConstructor flags=[HasNewTarget] parameters=[{type=anything}] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: anything, v1: anything):
    v2 = GetConstructPrototype v0 layout=L1
    v3 = NewObject v2 layout=L1
    v4 = Integer integer=1
    PropSet v3, v4 key="x"
    v6 = ToBoolean v1
    Branch v6 -> taken b1(), notTaken b2()
  b1():
    v7 = Integer integer=2
    PropSet v3, v7 key="y"
    Jump -> next b2()
  b2():
    Return v3
}
# ARM: construction f2@i{{*}} root v3: DoesNotLeak before-leak "x" at-exit "x" read-early initial-order "x" stores Unknown
# ARM-NOT: construction f2@i{{*}} "y"
# ARM: layout L1: DoesNotLeak Unknown set [0] orders [0]
# ARMFIELDS: DeclaredPart(L1#{{*}}, 0) = {1}
# ARMFIELDS: DeclaredPart(L1#{{*}}, 1) = {undefined|2}
